  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Development Project in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the development of Higher Education by providing a standard-class environment for learning. Therefore, the project will focus on access to and quality of Higher Education as well as the Management of the system. More importantly, the project would ensure access to an equitable quality high education for 40,000 students in 04 Universities/high Institutes.  

The specific objectives of the project are: (i) to improve access to Higher Education through the construction/rehabilitation and equipping of various facilities in the targeted Universities and high Institutes, (ii) to enhance the quality of Higher Education with (a) Academic Staff Development, (b) Job Market Analysis and Development of missing curricula and (c) Research&amp; Development, and (iii) to strengthen the management capacity of the Ministry of Higher Education, Scientific Research and Innovation through (a) the construction and equipping of the Headquarters of the MoHESRI, (b) Staff Development with Study Visits to Regional/International similar Institutions and Trainings as well as (c) Setting up of a Management Information System (MIS).</narrative>
  </description>
